@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class MainForm {
  - lastBirthDate : DateTime?
  + ShowInputDialog()
  + RenderResult()
}

class InputForm {
  + DayText : string
  + MonthText : string
  + YearText : string
}

class AgeController {
  + CalculateAge(day, month, year)
}

class AgeModel {
  + BirthDate : DateTime?
  + Result : AgeCalculationResult?
  + StateChanged : event
  + Calculate(birthDate, today)
}

class AgeCalculationResult

MainForm --> InputForm : opens
MainForm --> AgeController : sends user input
AgeController --> AgeModel : validates and updates
AgeModel --> MainForm : StateChanged
AgeModel --> AgeCalculationResult : stores

note right of AgeModel
Active model:
after recalculation it notifies
the view via StateChanged.
end note
@enduml
